-- input.md --
Natural size, centered:

<gno-mermaid>
pie
    "Yes" : 3
    "No" : 1
</gno-mermaid>

Shrunk when wider than its container:

<gno-mermaid width="fit">
pie
    "Yes" : 3
</gno-mermaid>

As wide as its container:

<gno-mermaid width="full">
pie
    "Yes" : 3
</gno-mermaid>

An unknown width shows the source:

<gno-mermaid width="huge">
pie
    "Yes" : 3
</gno-mermaid>
